SSB - K_SB.INC, the Sound Blaster ring
  a Sound Blaster at 0220h  IRQ 7  DMA 1  ring at segment 1193
PASS S1 the ring crosses no 64K page
  every effect mixed once, ticks: 6
PASS S2 every effect mixed into the ring and returned
  a second of SB_HEAL, calls: 16166  (the DMA position moved)
PASS S3 a second of SB_FX and SB_HEAL, no hang
PASS S4 SB_HEAL keeps every register
PASS S5 SB_DONE twice: silent, the 64K back with DOS
PASS S6 no sound chosen: SB_INIT CF=1, every call returns
PASS S7 no card at 280h: SB_INIT CF=1, no memory, calls return
PASS S8 BLASTER=a240 i10 d3: port 240h, IRQ 10, DMA 3
SSB done
